OL,3,GNEWSA'We need more council tax to pay
OL,4,Afor past mistakes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has said another
OL,7,Fcouncil tax rise above the usual limit
OL,8,Fis likely to be set next year to "pay
OL,9,Ffor the mistakes of the past".
OL,11,FHeather Kidd's Liberal Democrat
OL,12,Fadministration on Shropshire Council
OL,13,Fdeclared a financial emergency last
OL,14,FSeptember, following years of the
OL,15,Fauthority battling to deliver balanced
OL,16,Fbudgets.
OL,18,FAn independent report has laid bare the
OL,19,Fcouncil's "extremely poor financial
OL,20,Fhealth," in part due to "a lack of
OL,21,Fadequate financial management" under
OL,22,FConservative leadership.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
